   "text": "routed experts 128×57 **413.12B** (96.7%) · GQA attention ×60 **6.42B** (1.5%) · shared expert + router ×57 **3.27B** (0.8%) · MSA indexers ×57 **224.1M** (<0.1%) · dense FFN ×3 **679.5M** (0.2%) · embed **1.23B** (0.3%) · lm head **1.23B** (0.3%) · vision tower + projectors **865.6M** (0.2%) · RMSNorms **0.7M** (<0.1%)"
  },
