  {
   "id": "cap-bcl",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -900,
   "y": -1450,
   "width": 2600,
   "height": 64,
   "text": "routed experts 128×57 **12.91B** (52.2%) · GQA attention ×60 **6.42B** (25.9%) · MSA indexers ×57 **224.1M** (0.9%) · shared expert + router ×57 **3.27B** (13.2%) · dense FFN ×3 **679.5M** (2.7%) · lm head **1.23B** (5.0%) · embed **0** (row lookup) · vision tower + projectors **0** (runs per image) · RMSNorms **0.7M** (<0.1%)"
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-title",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -900,
   "y": -1300,
   "width": 1250,
   "height": 200,
   "text": "# MiniMax-M3 — model  \nOne continuous stack L0–59, read top → bottom; layers that repeat are drawn once with **×N**; images enter from the far left. **Grey bars = tensors**, length ∝ channels per token (0.08 px/channel). **Boxes = operations**, all one size; where parameters and compute live is the pair of bars above. T = sequence length, P = vision patches. *Layer* tab = one decoder layer in detail."
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-legend",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 450,
   "y": -1300,
   "width": 1250,
   "height": 200,
   "text": "Every layer = **GQA attention** (64 query / 4 KV heads × 128, per-head QK-norm, RoPE on 64 of 128 dims).    \nRow colours — **amber**: dense SwiGLU FFN 12288 + *full* causal attention (L0–2) · **cyan**: MoE + **MiniMax Sparse Attention** — a 4-head lightning indexer scores 128-token key blocks and each query attends only its top 16 blocks (+ 1 local), ≤ 2,048 keys. MoE = 4 of 128 routed experts + 1 shared, sigmoid router, routed sum ×2.0."
  },
  {
   "id": "img1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1450,
   "y": -980,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**image / video** frames (dynamic resolution)",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "patch2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1347,
   "y": -884,
   "width": 94,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
