  },
  {
   "id": "note-vision",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -2000,
   "y": -75,
   "width": 720,
   "height": 170,
   "text": "Vision tower: CLIP-style ViT (32 pre-LN blocks, width 1280, q/k/v/out with bias) whose queries and keys get a 3D (t, h, w) RoPE. Each patch is first projected to 6144 by `multi_modal_projector`, then 2×2 neighbours are concatenated and fused to one text-width token by `patch_merge_mlp`, so the LM sees P/4 image tokens. Video frames take the same path."
  },
  {
   "id": "seg0",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -80,
   "y": 16,
   "width": 460,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**L0–2** ×3  \ndense FFN · full attn",
   "color": "#fbbf24"
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -80,
   "y": 98,
   "width": 460,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**L3–59** ×57  \nMoE · MSA sparse",
   "color": "5"
  },
