   "y": 106,
   "width": 60,
   "height": 30,
   "text": "L59"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-dense",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 540,
   "y": 166,
   "width": 560,
   "height": 90,
   "text": "L0–2: no indexer weights — plain causal attention over every past token; dense SwiGLU 6144→12288→6144."
  },
  {
   "id": "note-sparse",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 540,
   "y": 286,
   "width": 560,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "L3–59: each layer runs its *own* indexer (3.9M); it adds a 128-dim key per token to the cache next to the 1024 K+V values. Every one of the 4 KV groups gets its own block pick, so at 1M context a query reads 2,048 keys instead of up to 1,048,576."
  },
  {
   "id": "xo29",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -96,
   "y": 220,
   "width": 492,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl30",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -556,
   "y": 208,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`x [T, 6144]  after L59`"
  },
  {
   "id": "fn31",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 269,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**final RMSNorm** (Gemma-style, × (1+w))",
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "xf32",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -96,
   "y": 365,
   "width": 492,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl33",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -556,
   "y": 353,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`x [T, 6144]`"
  },
  {
   "id": "head34",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 414,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**lm head** — 6144 → 200064  \n1.23B · not tied to embed",
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "logits35",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -750,
   "y": 510,
   "width": 1800,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl36",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1210,
   "y": 498,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`logits [T, 200064]` — bar clipped (real 16005px)"
  },
  {
   "id": "samp37",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 559,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**softmax → sample**",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "next38",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 655,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**next token id**",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-mtp",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 450,
   "y": 611,
   "width": 700,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**No drafting head drawn.** config.json declares `num_mtp_modules` = 7 and `num_nextn_predict_layers` = 1, but none of the 23,416 checkpoint tensors is an MTP weight, and transformers drops `mtp.*` keys on load."
  },
  {
   "id": "note-src",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -900,
   "y": 791,
   "width": 1300,
   "height": 170,
   "text": "**Sources.** config.json + safetensors headers of MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-M3 (23,416 tensors, BF16; router weights and the patch-embed conv in F32). Text model (L0–59, embed, head) = **426.17B**, + 865.6M vision. Dataflow from transformers modular_minimax_m3_vl.py. Context 1,048,576 positions; RoPE θ = 5,000,000 on the first 64 of 128 head dims, no scaling."
  }
 ],
